    {
      "id": "u_751fa2667ba7961f72602366_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Block quotes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "751fa2667ba7961f7260236662174270e93d87e6aad720e2d1e37a83fa274722",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Block quotes",
      "contextHash": "33ec9adb7996699b8160a77e45b4eeee947c43bb3d68a7009b0e8e9033b59f71",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f7de5cebd328a80883b5a84d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "As the name suggests, block quotes can be useful to cite one or more paragraphs.",
      "sourceHash": "f7de5cebd328a80883b5a84d0fa174c46ef95934e5a456ca46a2a292dd624714",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Block quotes",
      "contextHash": "33ec9adb7996699b8160a77e45b4eeee947c43bb3d68a7009b0e8e9033b59f71",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_892d30811660744d6f365679_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To create a block quote, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__ from the __TRILIUM_PH_1__Formatting toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_2__. It's also possible to type __TRILIUM_PH_3__>__TRILIUM_PH_4__, followed by a space to create one (but only if the cursor is at the beginning of a line).",
      "sourceHash": "892d30811660744d6f365679ac8cbf44360985264d488e515eeebd7c73058696",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Block quotes",
      "contextHash": "33ec9adb7996699b8160a77e45b4eeee947c43bb3d68a7009b0e8e9033b59f71",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ea6421b2f207e7bbdca0964f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Inside the quote block, other block items can be inserted such as tables, images, or even other block quotes or admonitions.",
      "sourceHash": "ea6421b2f207e7bbdca0964f4078779cadf6da33ef6250075649abe8eeba20a7",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Block quotes",
      "contextHash": "33ec9adb7996699b8160a77e45b4eeee947c43bb3d68a7009b0e8e9033b59f71",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4b3d822a7b4bdec9716444b5_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Admonitions__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "4b3d822a7b4bdec9716444b5cc220296c721ff91dcee6bc2e1fc67d9cf521320",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions",
      "contextHash": "687aaffb9ffde1bb979dd6bd16c8079f791664d1b63501cc5b58e79d733df1f9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_03e188bc676defc6d47822d8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Admonitions are a way to highlight information to the reader. Other names for it include __TRILIUM_PH_0__call-outs__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__info/warning/alert boxes__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "03e188bc676defc6d47822d8ebe57b68f6c1dbf016e886057925ca9554f55580",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions",
      "contextHash": "687aaffb9ffde1bb979dd6bd16c8079f791664d1b63501cc5b58e79d733df1f9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bcb7a7b1e552419df899f5ef_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "From a functional point of view, admonitions act very similarly to a block quote, just with different styling. This includes the ability to insert other elements in it such as headings, tables, images, etc.",
      "sourceHash": "bcb7a7b1e552419df899f5ef3a8e7e7d4363037364143bfbdbfeed5f8335cb16",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions",
      "contextHash": "687aaffb9ffde1bb979dd6bd16c8079f791664d1b63501cc5b58e79d733df1f9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_77eee46b76f82ca04d169c48_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Inserting a new admonition__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "77eee46b76f82ca04d169c481cc4bda2bada5c1b8a3c90abc3c7abf759680354",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Inserting a new admonition",
      "contextHash": "8275aff546c994b398ee6930c174ff32a85f78ec45a4cf28d3945979d76e0382",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_46f239d4a27bcb2a767b8795_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Formatting toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_1__:",
      "sourceHash": "46f239d4a27bcb2a767b87953e42dd49d5e83506d0c9d7ed85d3477b3deb4d08",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Inserting a new admonition",
      "contextHash": "8275aff546c994b398ee6930c174ff32a85f78ec45a4cf28d3945979d76e0382",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e2696ecadb716f3cb2483714_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "It's possible to insert an admonition simply by typing:",
      "sourceHash": "e2696ecadb716f3cb2483714614f2a981fb4d1208646526c83e618d77701491a",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Inserting a new admonition",
      "contextHash": "8275aff546c994b398ee6930c174ff32a85f78ec45a4cf28d3945979d76e0382",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_50aedc57a159c093cb57a44d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In addition to that, it's also possible to type __TRILIUM_PH_0__  followed by any text, case in which a default admonition type will appear (note) with the entered text inside it.",
      "sourceHash": "50aedc57a159c093cb57a44dc4e9c754a727768c004942a1e93ef7605e86f9df",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Inserting a new admonition",
      "contextHash": "8275aff546c994b398ee6930c174ff32a85f78ec45a4cf28d3945979d76e0382",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e869f14815ca9f42af6aabcb_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Interaction__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "e869f14815ca9f42af6aabcb2850edd1acc151bfa740d234b22ea9ce50d92ab2",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a924f856d074498c0ef29da88ea2551ff5b33cb034dae61a142bb60eb0dce19b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9565be2d4b61857482537f77_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "By design, admonitions act very similar to block quotes.",
      "sourceHash": "9565be2d4b61857482537f778a741c3cc0accedf9be02d41cd8c2b8e81d18eb5",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a924f856d074498c0ef29da88ea2551ff5b33cb034dae61a142bb60eb0dce19b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_07451b7afd2f1c51ffd8f44b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Selecting a text and pressing the admonition button will turn that text into an admonition.",
      "sourceHash": "07451b7afd2f1c51ffd8f44bcfe5ab04f368459cd0ab12ccd8a3a10d2853fbb4",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a924f856d074498c0ef29da88ea2551ff5b33cb034dae61a142bb60eb0dce19b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5ad2c2fc54eb0f0f2fa1375f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If selecting multiple admonitions, pressing the admonition button will automatically merge them into one.",
      "sourceHash": "5ad2c2fc54eb0f0f2fa1375fe50a9235a71f3b201f8e34bf14c0ac2d8b53335a",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a924f856d074498c0ef29da88ea2551ff5b33cb034dae61a142bb60eb0dce19b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_be0cc058925265e9222067af_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Inside an admonition:",
      "sourceHash": "be0cc058925265e9222067af723845e56c0dac176597a94cb10eff99f5ca1912",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a924f856d074498c0ef29da88ea2551ff5b33cb034dae61a142bb60eb0dce19b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eb06da70101d84d6792ef369_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Pressing __TRILIUM_PH_0__Backspace__TRILIUM_PH_1__ while the admonition is empty will remove it.",
      "sourceHash": "eb06da70101d84d6792ef3690ea49b140f77492d62f22e199462a60babcfccf5",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a924f856d074498c0ef29da88ea2551ff5b33cb034dae61a142bb60eb0dce19b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cdb3a1c1efc6381651cf9641_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Pressing __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__ will start a new paragraph. Pressing it twice will exit out of the admonition.",
      "sourceHash": "cdb3a1c1efc6381651cf9641ca3142fdcb7d4a9c3fedd288775faf015f7b9583",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a924f856d074498c0ef29da88ea2551ff5b33cb034dae61a142bb60eb0dce19b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7b1fe916bba73bbb7319e029_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Headings and other block content including tables can be inserted inside the admonition.",
      "sourceHash": "7b1fe916bba73bbb7319e029ca660f311cb1d8ad839f75ec03f6b1ef7079fb7c",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a924f856d074498c0ef29da88ea2551ff5b33cb034dae61a142bb60eb0dce19b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d1a0477752ebf10642824f8b_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Types of admonitions__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "d1a0477752ebf10642824f8b875fd6d0b7fb5992c7c369b703885e08ca89e6c5",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Types of admonitions",
      "contextHash": "03a231798fd5ddfd3d302beb91c209b7d879235c8ed27f3c01cf79fc650d57cb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_15db42851713d5a602372575_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There are currently five types of admonitions: __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note__TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__Tip__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Important__TRILIUM_PH_5__, __TRILIUM_PH_6__Caution__TRILIUM_PH_7__, __TRILIUM_PH_8__Warning__TRILIUM_PH_9__.",
      "sourceHash": "15db42851713d5a602372575065c9453ea79d29a2042da9050780689eb3c4e17",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Types of admonitions",
      "contextHash": "03a231798fd5ddfd3d302beb91c209b7d879235c8ed27f3c01cf79fc650d57cb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_768e233695bf7b274074d58e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "These types were inspired by GitHub's support for this feature and there are currently no plans for adjusting it or allowing the user to customize them.",
      "sourceHash": "768e233695bf7b274074d58ea9303e241724303057daf8b4929ca04718f7cb74",
      "context": "Block quotes & admonitions > Admonitions > Types of admonitions",
      "contextHash": "03a231798fd5ddfd3d302beb91c209b7d879235c8ed27f3c01cf79fc650d57cb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
